# A loaded Caravel sails back into a friendly colony. Input: output of map_board_and_ferry (Caravel A at
# (48,24) carrying a sentried Colonist and a sentried Preacher), with its moves refilled (spent byte 0).
key KP_7                   # (47,23)
key KP_4                   # (46,23)
key KP_1                   # into Quebec (45,24): ship docks and ends its move, passengers are put ashore and woken
wait 30                    # next unit with moves (colonist id 88 in Guadeloupe) is auto-selected
click 184 112              # open Quebec on the map
wait 10
click 312 155              # Units pane tab: the two ex-passengers stand among the units present, the ship is docked
key Escape                 # back to the map
